Fire an arrow for [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] weapon damage. When the arrow reaches its destination or hits a target it will draw in all other targets in a radius of [2, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] and inflict [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical damage.

Each target moved beyond the first increases the damage [17, 24, 28, 32, 36 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] (up to [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] bonus damage).

Targets take reduced damage the further they are from the epicenter (20% less per tile).

The additional damage scales with your Spellpower.
